Some few-shot examples after column exploration may be helpful:
Query:
--Description: 1) Inspect the range of heavy-atom counts that are already stored in the master
--              compound properties table.  This gives a feeling for how many compounds fall
--              into the 10-15 heavy-atom window that we will need later on.
SELECT DISTINCT
       "heavy_atoms"
FROM   "EBI_CHEMBL"."EBI_CHEMBL"."COMPOUND_PROPERTIES"
WHERE  "heavy_atoms" IS NOT NULL
LIMIT  20;
